---
// The API message list with the status bar: fixed system + tools, the conversation rounds, the user follow-up, then <agent_status> as the final user message, next to where generation starts (redraw of Fig 2-15).
---

<svg
	class="dg"
	viewBox="0 0 720 820"
	role="img"
	aria-labelledby="d2-sbp-title d2-sbp-desc"
	style="min-width: 630px"
>
	<title id="d2-sbp-title">Insertion position of the Agent Status Bar in the API message list</title>
	<desc id="d2-sbp-desc">
		A messages array, top to bottom. Fixed, in the KV Cache: a system message, "You are a telecom customer service
		agent...", and the tools list: cancel_plan, query_records and more. Then a user message, "Help me cancel my plan";
		an assistant message with the tool call cancel_plan; a tool message, "This plan has a contract period..."; and an
		assistant message, "Your plan is within the contract period...". More conversation turns follow. Then the user
		follow-up, "Then help me check my call records". Last comes the agent status bar, inserted by the Agent framework:
		a user message whose content is an agent_status block, "Called 3/3 times, TODO: Cancel plan (in progress)". The
		array closes, and the model starts generating from there. The status bar is adjacent to the start of model
		generation and receives the highest attention weight.
	</desc>

	<text x="2" y="28" class="dg-title">Where the status bar sits in the message list</text>
	<text x="4" y="62" class="dg-mono" font-weight="700">messages: [</text>

	<!-- Fixed prefix -->
	<text x="12" y="92" class="dg-sub">fixed (KV Cache)</text>
	<g class="dg-node dg-context">
		<rect x="12" y="102" width="704" height="64" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="26" y="128" class="dg-mono">{'{ role: "system",'}</text>
		<text x="46" y="152" class="dg-mono">{'content: "You are a telecom customer service agent..." }'}</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-context">
		<rect x="12" y="172" width="704" height="40" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="26" y="198" class="dg-mono">tools: [cancel_plan, query_records, ...]</text>
	</g>

	<!-- Conversation -->
	<g class="dg-node dg-neutral">
		<rect x="12" y="228" width="704" height="40" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="26" y="254" class="dg-mono">{'{ role: "user", content: "Help me cancel my plan" }'}</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-model">
		<rect x="12" y="274" width="704" height="40" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="26" y="300" class="dg-mono">{'{ role: "assistant", tool_calls: [cancel_plan(...)] }'}</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-tools">
		<rect x="12" y="320" width="704" height="40" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="26" y="346" class="dg-mono">{'{ role: "tool", content: "This plan has a contract period..." }'}</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-model">
		<rect x="12" y="366" width="704" height="64" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="26" y="392" class="dg-mono">{'{ role: "assistant",'}</text>
		<text x="46" y="416" class="dg-mono">{'content: "Your plan is within the contract period..." }'}</text>
	</g>
	<text x="364" y="460" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">... more conversation turns ...</text>

	<!-- User follow-up -->
	<text x="12" y="494" class="dg-sub">user follow-up</text>
	<g class="dg-node dg-neutral">
		<rect x="12" y="504" width="704" height="40" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="26" y="530" class="dg-mono">{'{ role: "user", content: "Then help me check my call records" }'}</text>
	</g>

	<!-- Status bar -->
	<text x="12" y="578" font-weight="700">Agent framework insertion: agent status bar</text>
	<g class="dg-node dg-harness" style="font-variant-ligatures: none">
		<rect x="12" y="588" width="704" height="88" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="26" y="614" class="dg-mono">{'{ role: "user", content: "<agent_status>'}</text>
		<text x="46" y="638" class="dg-mono">Called 3/3 times · TODO: Cancel plan (in progress)</text>
		<text x="46" y="662" class="dg-mono">{'</agent_status>" }'}</text>
	</g>
	<text x="4" y="708" class="dg-mono" font-weight="700">]</text>

	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="182" y1="678" x2="182" y2="736" marker-end="url(#d2-sbp-arrow)"></line>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-model">
		<rect x="12" y="740" width="340" height="40" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="28" y="766" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">model starts generating from here</text>
	</g>
	<text x="12" y="806" class="dg-sub">↑ adjacent to model generation start, receives highest attention weight</text>

	<defs>
		<marker id="d2-sbp-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto-start-reverse">
			<path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" class="dg-arrowhead"></path>
		</marker>
	</defs>
</svg>
